*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
*  ADSC DIALOG DEFINITION      COMPANY CAR RETURN
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD DIALOG FLERETN VERSION 1
    DESCRIPTION IS 'COMPANY CAR RETURN'
    SUBSCHEMA IS FLEETSS1 OF SCHEMA FLEETSCH VERSION 1
    MAP IS FLERETNM VERSION 1
    WORK RECORD IS FLEWORK
    PREMAP PROCESS IS FLERETN-PREMAP
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLERETN-ENTER  RESPONSE KEY IS ENTER
       EXECUTE ON EDIT ERRORS
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLERETN-PF3    RESPONSE KEY IS PF3
    .
